 Compute the free energy of solvation of a solute in liquid octanol (N = 500).

In any directory, one just needs xDGOCT and xGETDGoct
And the solute Z-matrix (zmat.z) needs to be (currently) in boss/molecules/OPLS2020.
Then just execute
xDGOCT zmat

This will create the directory zmat with subdirectories for the 4 FEP jobs -
Q and LJ for gas phase and in octanol.

After the 4 jobs finish, the results can be collected via
xGETDGoct zmat

